From 3332c0411f5027c2c56abc66240415436c182c4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: palazik <gochmyradov0@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:15:55 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] dodge: add OnePlus 13 (SM8750) board config

Adds an ARM64_BOARD_CONFIG_DODGE board for a from-source xnu-8796 bring-up on
the OnePlus 13 (Qualcomm SM8750 / Oryon), reusing XNU's built-in non-Apple-board
support (open nos_arm_pmap/nos_arm_asm, GICv3, 16K) rather than the closed KDK
SoC library. Plain arm64 (no PAC) for first bring-up.

 - pexpert/arm64/DODGE.h: board header (NO_MONITOR, HAS_GIC_V3, 16K; GICv3 reg
   defs; SM8750 redistributor stride 0x40000; virtual timer INTID 27).
 - pexpert/arm64/board_config.h: DODGE block (MAX_CPUS/clusters).
 - makedefs/MakeInc.def: register DODGE machine config; keep it plain arm64.
 - config/MASTER.arm64.dodge: MacOSX base + nos_arm_asm/nos_arm_pmap, drop kpc.

Method (build-from-source + non-Apple board config) credit: dipa-studio/ios-sweet.
Our own files; no code copied.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
